= Solution
{parent=ii}

Statement (ii) is true. Since $\Delta(-\phi)=0$, applying the maximum principle to $-\phi$ gives
$$
\boxed{\min_{\overline\Omega}\phi
=\min_{\partial\Omega}\phi}.
$$

