$$
\mathbb E(M_t\mid\mathcal F_s)
=M_s\,
\mathbb E\exp\left(c(W_t-W_s)-\frac{c^2}{2}(t-s)\right)
=M_s.
$$
Also $\mathbb E M_t=1$, so $M$ is the <exponential Brownian martingale>.

